        <rule id="3542-6817-d0c6-ab2a" name="Sun&apos;s Brilliance" publicationId="555e-9663-pubN65910" page="106" hidden="false">
          <description>When Baharroth enters play from Deep Strike, all enemy units within 6&quot; must take a test as if hit by a weapon with the Blind special rule. Models that are immune to the Blind special rule are immune to Sun&apos;s Brilliance.</description>
