        <profile id="8f15-3680-5dfe-10f3" name="Bel-Annath" publicationId="555e-9663-pubN70264" page="141" hidden="false" typeId="bc97-dea9-9e88-bb7d" typeName="Psyker">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Mastery Level" typeId="ca56-02c3-af4b-ea2a">3</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Disciplines" typeId="ea53-f5c7-08e4-980c">Bel-Annath always has the following Psychic powers from the Runes of Fate and Pyromancy Disciplines: Doom, Fire Shield and Molten Beam</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="fe0a-12f8-40d1-c350" name="Warlord Trait: A Path Once Walked" publicationId="555e-9663-pubN70264" page="141" hidden="false">
          <description>Whilst Bel-Annath is part of a unit of Fire Dragon Aspect Warriors, he is affected by the Assured Destruction special rule. In addition, when Bel-Annath is selected as an army&apos;s Warlord, that army may include a single unit of Fire Dragons that does not use up a Force Organisation slot, but must be joined by Bel-Annath during deployment.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
