    <selectionEntry id="94f6-c839-9fba-29b6" name="Fire Prisms" publicationId="555e-9663-pubN65910" page="132" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit">
      <rules>
        <rule id="1867-e67e-d415-a29e" name="Linked Fire" publicationId="555e-9663-pubN65910" page="131" hidden="false">
          <description>If a Fire Prism squadron contains more than one model, the squadron can link its prism cannons instead of firing normally. Nominate one model in the squadron as the firer; the other models in the squadron cannot fire their prism cannons this turn. The firer shoots with its prism cannon as normal, adding 1 to the Strength (to a maximum of 10) and subtracting 1 from the AP (to a minimum of 1) for each Fire Prism in the suadron that could have otherwise fired its prism cannon normally. For example, a squadron of 3 Fire Prisms, 1 of which is affected by a Crew Stunned result and can only fire Snap Shots, could fire a single focused shot at Strength 8 AP1.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup id="5ea1-53d3-945d-ab94" name="Squadron Members - 1 to 3" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" defaultSelectionEntryId="c65b-0f1c-7e62-9b68">
