          </profiles>
          <rules>
            <rule id="f7c4-414b-9935-cc4a" name="Voidshot" publicationId="555e-9663-pubN65910" page="101" hidden="false">
              <description>When rolling To Wound for a weapon that has this special rule, a roll of 6 causes a Wound with the Instant Death special rule. When making an Armour Penetration roll for a weapon that has this special rule, a roll of 6 causes a penetrating hit, regardless of the vehicle&apos;s Armour Value.</description>
