              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In close combat, the Spear of Starlight has 2 values for Strength and AP. The first value is used on any turn in which Irillyth has charged; the second is used at all other times.</characteristic>
