        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="85d9-28ad-eb2d-7b99" name="Disarming Strike" publicationId="555e-9663-pubN65910" page="103" hidden="false">
          <description>Before rolling To Hit whilst in a challenge, Jain Zar can choose to nominate one of her opponent&apos;s melee weapons. Her opponent counts as not being equipped with that weapon until the end of the phase. If Jain Zar does this, she makes one less Attack than normal this phase.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="4329-c5cf-d4a7-7f00" name="Warlord Trait: Falcon&apos;s Swiftness" publicationId="555e-9663-pubN65910" page="148" hidden="false">
          <description>The Warlord and his unit add 3 to the dice roll when determining how far they can Run (this will normally be D6+3&quot;).</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink id="40ef-b8da-a394-0200" hidden="false" targetId="cec1-79db-d2d2-2f40" type="rule" name="Acrobatic"/>
