              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Models cannot fire Overwatch against Jain Zar or a unit she has joined, and enemy models within 6&quot; of Jain Zar subtract 5 from their Weapon Skill and Initiative (to a minimum of 1).</characteristic>
