    <selectionEntry id="16a3-ea89-f355-deda" name="Night Spinners" publicationId="555e-9663-pubN65910" page="133" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit">
      <rules>
        <rule id="c863-53ae-7e36-8b27" name="Monofilament Shroud" publicationId="555e-9663-pubN65910" page="131" hidden="false">
          <description>If a Night Spinner squadron contains more than one model, the squadron can fire a Monofilament Shroud instead of firing normally. Nominate one model in the squadron as the firer; the other models in the squadron cannot fire their Doomweavers this turn. The nominated model shoots using the Doomweaver&apos;s dispersed profile, adding 1 to the Strength and number of shots fired for each other model in the squadron that could have otherwise fired its Doomweaver normally. For example, a squadron of 3 Night Spinners, 1 of which is affected by a Crew Stunned result and cannot fire its Doomweaver this turn, would fire 2 shots, each resolved at Strength 8.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup id="41ba-b9b6-86f8-ea8e" name="Squadron Members - 1 to 3" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" defaultSelectionEntryId="50c6-9010-ff69-fe1f">
