    <selectionEntry id="77fb-d381-7a54-5ff4" name="Swooping Hawks" publicationId="555e-9663-pubN65910" page="123" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit">
      <rules>
        <rule id="5362-9c99-766d-2129" name="Intercept" publicationId="555e-9663-pubN65910" page="123" hidden="false">
          <description>At the end of the Movement phase, a model with this special rule can make one Attack against an enemy Flyer or Flying Monsterous Creature that it moved ofter that turn. The Attack hits on a roll of 4+, and is resolved at Strength 4 AP 4 with the Haywire special rule. Flyers are hit on their side armour.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
