            <characteristic name="Disciplines" typeId="ea53-f5c7-08e4-980c">Wraithseers do not generate their psychic powers using the standard rules. Instead, they automatically gain all three Wraithseer powers.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="c6c8-78c4-9b70-61c2" name="Wraithseer Powers" publicationId="555e-9663-pubN70264" page="213" hidden="false">
          <description>Enliven (1 warp charge): This is a Blessing which targets a single friendly unit of Wraithguard, Wraithblades, or a single Wraithlord. Whilst the power is in effect, the target unit gains the Fleet special rule.

Foreboding (1 warp charge): Foreboding is a Witchfire power with the following profile: Range 18&quot; Str 3 AP5 Assault D6, Aether Shock

Aether Shock: If this attack hits then the targeted unit must take a Pinning test with a -2 Ld penalty.

Deliverance (1 warp charge): This is a Blessing which targets a single friendly unit of Wraithguard, Wraithblades, or a single Wraithlord. Whilst the power is in effect, the target unit gains the Feel No Pain (5+) special rule.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
